			<Comment Bounds="495 155 460 68" Id="84" xmlns="http://www.ni.com/MocCommon">
				<p.Text>"The SequenceView control generates the CreateContextMenu event when\nthe user right clicks on the control. The user interface can then create\na context menu to display.\n\nNote: This VI is marked to be reentrant since it is an ActiveX event callback VI."</p.Text>
			</Comment>
